    mas:containsSemanticGroup d:semantic-group .

# mas:containsSemanticGroup is sh:minCount 1, sh:severity sh:Violation on
# mas:MAS (semantic-ontology.ttl). A Dispatch issue has no embedding
# clustering, so this node and its four mandatory values exist only because
# the shapes demand them; see claim ts-forced-embedding.

